        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Until we establish our own cGMP manufacturing facility, we expect to continue to rely on third parties for the production of clinical quantities of our product candidates, and expect to rely in the future on third parties for the production of commercial quantities.",
