        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are able to internally manufacture limited quantities of product candidates for short-duration preclinical animal studies, which we believe allows us to accelerate certain aspects of development.",
